WEBVTT

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.060
We're all done!

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.130
It's winter break!

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:23.180
Kobayakawa-san.

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.400
Here. It's a present for you.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.080
Huh?

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:29.750
<i>Mocchi's giving Kobayakawa-san a present?</i>

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:33.300
I just wanted to give you this.
I don't need anything in return.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.380
Thank you.

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>Why's he so unfazed?</i>

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:16.940
What? The 24th?

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.400
I'm free then.

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:20.200
You're not working?

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.400
No, I have the day off.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.950
Then, could we go somewhere together?

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:27.330
Sure. That's fine.

00:02:28.470 --> 00:02:29.580
That's how it went.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.770
Nice one, Na-chan!

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:33.170
Good for you.

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:35.170
So that's why it didn't bother you.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.140
Right!

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:39.280
I'm so glad I worked up the courage to ask!

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:41.330
Meanwhile, I've got nothing.

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:42.920
That's never happened to me before.

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:47.560
And that's why the two of us are
going to our class Christmas party.

00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:49.310
What about Tsutsui-san?

00:02:51.010 --> 00:02:52.850
Said she's visiting her brother.

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:55.740
<i>So that's why Kobayakawa-san was available!</i>

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:00.050
Caught a cold?

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:02.780
No, I don't think so.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:04.200
Oh! It could mean...

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:07.590
Kobayakawa-san might be
talking about me right now!

00:03:07.590 --> 00:03:10.110
<i>He's in a really good mood...</i>

00:03:10.110 --> 00:03:13.500
Next stop is Main street.

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:17.670
I'm getting off here.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.080
Gotta buy a present!

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:20.570
Sure. Good luck with that.

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:21.930
You can do it!

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:25.890
<i>Going present-shopping makes me nervous...</i>

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:29.250
<i>But this is for Kobayakawa-san.
I have to do my best, even on my own!</i>

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:31.350
Na-chan.

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:34.520
I'll shop, too.

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.560
Wow!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:38.280
Tsuyopon!

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:44.140
Oh, right.

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:45.490
It's your one-year anniversary.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:49.770
You did tell us you met
your girlfriend during Christmas.

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:50.730
Yeah.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:54.910
So I thought I'd get her
something appropriate, but...

00:03:58.150 --> 00:04:00.420
...I have no idea what to buy.

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:07.260
I'll be going to Tokyo
for an event around New Year's.

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:09.600
so l don't have much of a budget.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.050
Neither do I.

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:13.060
I'd love to get something like this, but...

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:16.390
...it feels like it's too soon,

00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:20.150
since we're still just friends,
accessories won't work as a gift

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:30.870
I'm glad I was able to buy us matching mugs!

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:31.820
Yeah.

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:33.210
I'll take good care of mine.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.530
Can we stop in here?

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:36.410
Sure!

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:39.360
What are you going to buy?

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:40.920
This place isn't really your style.

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:44.050
A return gift for Mochizuki-kun.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:46.090
And a present for Hashiba-kun.

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:49.190
Why for that little monkey?

00:04:49.190 --> 00:04:51.510
We're going somewhere on the 24th.

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:52.720
Huh?!

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:55.230
How come you didn't tell me?!

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:57.490
He invited me yesterday.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:04:59.110
Huh?!

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:03.640
I wanna come, too!

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:06.050
I'll turn down Maa-kun and his wife!

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:08.140
I wouldn't have any fun there!

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:09.740
But you promised them.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:12.660
Well, I thought you'd be working that day...

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.370
You did last year...

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:16.460
Okay then, Anna...

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:19.830
This should be his present!

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.140
It's not very Christmas-y.

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:26.000
Come on! A pile of poop's
good enough for that guy!

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:27.320
Give him the poop!

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:30.850
<i>Come to think of it, what kind
of present is best for a boy?</i>

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:33.180
<i>What was it that Hashiba-kun likes?</i>

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:37.550
<i>...I don't know.</i>

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:39.000
Tsuyopon!

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:42.100
<i>Oh, it's Hashiba-kun.
Did you buy yours?</i>

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:43.050
Yes.

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:43.330
What did you get?

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:44.270
<i>With Naoe-kun?</i>

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:45.390
It's a secret.

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:57.070
Mari-chan, there's a shop I want to check out.

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:59.170
Sure, fine by me.

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:05.590
I managed to buy her a present.

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:08.060
I can't wait for the day to arrive!

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:09.590
The big day!

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:11.510
I don't have a plan yet!

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:20.740
<i>It'd be bad if I caught a cold
and was sick that day.</i>

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:22.270
<i>I should keep warm.</i>

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:24.580
<i>Okay.</i>

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:26.970
<i>Kobayakawa-san likes sweets.</i>

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:29.240
<i>So a place with good desserts would be great!</i>

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.680
Huh. There's a bunch of them.

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:37.740
<i>It's a Christmas with just me
and Kobayakawa-san.</i>

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:39.590
<i>I hope I can give us a fun day.</i>

00:06:39.590 --> 00:06:41.670
<i>And then tell her I love her!</i>

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.690
<i>I'm fifteen minutes early.</i>

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:50.390
<i>I haven't forgotten anything.</i>

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:51.890
<i>It's gonna be okay.</i>

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.820
<i>Is Kobayakawa-san already here?</i>

00:06:58.810 --> 00:06:59.890
Sorry for the wait.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:02.590
<i>Kobayakawa-san!</i>

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:04.140
You're here early. Did you wait long?

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:05.770
No, not at all!

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:09.460
There are lots of people today...

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:11.050
Right?

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:12.020
Y-Yeah.

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:13.950
<i>I'm extremely happy!</i>

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:15.890
Where are we going?

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:17.870
To a place in Minami Building.

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:20.130
The desserts there are well-rated.

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:23.610
And I heard there were some
exclusive sweets there today.

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:26.650
I can't wait to try them!

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:27.860
Sure.

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:29.050
It's this way.

00:07:30.230 --> 00:07:31.570
<i>Thank goodness.</i>

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:33.110
<i>It looks like she'll like it.</i>

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:37.390
<i>Guys, I'm going to give it
everything I've got today!</i>

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:42.020
Yay! Katakura-kun loses!

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:45.690
Gulping down a glass of cola's easy!

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:46.930
Wow!

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:48.320
Chug it!

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:53.530
Keiichi.

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:55.830
Here. For you.

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:56.450
Huh?

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:58.390
What's this? For me?

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:00.280
From you?

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:02.870
No, Nozomi!
She told me to give it to you!

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.110
Oh. Thanks.

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:06.540
I'll have to thank her for it.

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:10.420
Listen, pal...you'd better not—

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.460
Buu-chan beat Mattsun's score!

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:13.750
Huh?!

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:15.460
No way! Just now?

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:17.240
Hey! Pass me that tablet!

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:19.140
I'm going to get serious!

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:25.190
It's a pink gold necklace!

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:27.670
Thank you, Tsuyoponnu!

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:28.650
Mm.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:32.360
I wasn't sure about getting
one with our initials.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.480
But the clerk recommended it.

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:35.950
It's the best!

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:38.030
This means we'll always be together!

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:40.950
Ho, ho, ho.

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:44.450
Now then, old man Santa, let's have cake!

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:46.170
I'm an old man?

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:48.710
Why would you choose that setting?

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:50.840
Delicious...

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:54.890
Thank you for bringing me
to such a great place.

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:56.720
W-Well, it is Christmas, after all.

00:08:57.650 --> 00:08:58.880
I see.

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:02.690
This is the first time I've ever
celebrated Christmas like this.

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:04.340
Last year I had to work.

00:09:04.340 --> 00:09:05.680
Same for me.

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:07.850
I've always ended up lazing the day away.

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:08.770
Huh?

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:09.740
But I thought—

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:13.780
Oh! Last year, my girlfriend and I
broke up before we went anywhere.

00:09:14.810 --> 00:09:16.280
<i>Such a humiliating memory.</i>

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:18.870
I'm surprised you remembered.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:20.070
Yeah.

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:21.460
I do remember.

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:24.720
The fact that I've made so many friends.

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:26.870
And that we've visited so
many different places,

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:30.690
is all because I met you a year ago.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:35.920
Thanks to you, this whole year
has been wonderful.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:41.140
Meeting that way may have
been awkward for you, though.

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:42.600
No, not at all!

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:44.880
When I think back on it,

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:47.060
coincidences can be so amazing!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:49.020
It was fun!

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:51.430
I hope we'll stay close like this.

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:53.380
I... I hope so too.

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:58.710
<i>Kobayakawa-san makes me
so happy with the things she says.</i>

00:09:58.710 --> 00:10:00.100
<i>I'm so touched!</i>

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:02.280
<i>How should I confess to her?</i>

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:04.790
<i>Oh! I just remembered!</i>

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:09.540
Kobayakawa-san, after this,
would you like to go see the tree?

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.210
The park has an indoor Christmas tree.

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:15.960
I hear it's beautiful,
But it is a kind of far away...

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:17.970
ls something wrong?

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:18.880
Oh!

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:21.620
No, nothing.

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:22.550
A tree?

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:23.990
Right!

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:26.430
We could walk, or we could take a bus.

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:29.100
Kobayakawa-san, which would you...

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:33.400
Kobayakawa-san?

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:34.420
Um...

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:36.450
I need to go make a call.

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:37.660
Oh, sure.

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:39.030
I'm sorry,

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:42.350
<i>What was that?</i>

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:43.880
<i>She suddenly went pale..</i>

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:56.840
Welcome back.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:58.130
Was it okay?

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:00.680
Um, I'm terribly sorry, but...

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:03.060
I need to do something for a bit.

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:05.560
Could you wait here for a little while?

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:08.280
Huh? Right now?
Is everything okay?

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:09.820
Would you rather go home?

00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:11.470
No.

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:13.700
Um... don't worry.

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:16.390
I'll be right back.

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:17.680
I'm sorry.

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:18.920
See you in a bit.

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:19.560
Huh?

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:26.200
Kobayakawa-san...?

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:30.370
What is it... you need to go do?
